  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#2dc26b\">現已提供 1.20.4 版本！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ysHTfupk3Lk\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshockbyte.com%252fpartner%252fdnator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/286633/description_53be4d91-93d7-4052-b05d-a85e17c04184.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"142\"></em></span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">注意事項：若要啟用連線紋理功能，您必須安裝 Optifine、Continuity 或其他連線紋理替代模組。</span></span></strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>徹底消除玻璃與冰塊紋理中惱人的條紋，帶來前所未有的清晰視野！</p>\n<p>各位網友好！在四處搜尋簡單清晰的玻璃紋理包後，我製作了這個資源包。我覺得這類資源包雖然滿天飛，但總覺得哪裡怪怪的……有時會遇到顏色不對的，有時又缺少連線紋理支援，還有的解析度根本不對。於是我便動手做了自己的版本！</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:medium\">為何&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:medium\">選擇&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:medium\">這個透明玻璃包？</span></strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大多數玻璃紋理包並未內建連線紋理。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>大面積窗戶不會有撞擊「隱形牆」的問題。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>100% 完美還原原版彩色玻璃顏色。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong><span style=\"font-size=medium\">此包內容包含：</span></strong></span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>具備連線紋理的透明普通玻璃（精緻模式）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>具備連線紋理的透明彩色玻璃變體（精緻模式）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>具備連線紋理的染色玻璃（精緻模式）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果您是內容創作者並希望使用此資源包，請將下載連結放入您的影片描述或適合您平台的任何位置。這對我來說幫助非常大，也能讓我會心一笑！</strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:14px\"><strong>透明玻璃包 歸屬標示範本</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>透明玻璃包由 @DnatorGames 製作 (<a href=\"http://twitter.com/DnatorGames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">http://twitter.com/DnatorGames</span></a>)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>下載處：<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/clear-glass-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/clear-glass-pack</span></a></strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/dnator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xsB1kE5.png\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DnatorGames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TmTGk6S.png\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/dnator\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xEmLl9u.png\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:18px\">此資源包主打&nbsp;<strong>透明玻璃</strong>與<strong>連線紋理！</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RmcJXYF.gif\" alt=\"透明玻璃動態 GIF 展示\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<em><strong>注意事項：若要啟用連線紋理功能，您必須安裝 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a></span>。</strong></em></p>\n<hr>",
